      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "LITTLE DAN (3) is a talented type and proved too classy last time to win by 3.5 lengths at this track in a handy 19.36 beating SYDNEY DANGER. Shapes as a top winning chance on latest effort. WHERE'S AUNTY (1) scored well last start as odds-on favourite by 8 lengths at this track in a handy 19.81 beating Blackpool Myer. Draws the cherry and goes well over this trip. Yet to win out of this box but has been in the placings three times from six starts. Leading player again. SAVE TONIGHT (7) is rarely far away but tends to find one better, placing 37 from 69 starts. Has been in the minors the last two runs, the latest finishing third (19.69) at this track. Has a good record at this journey. Leading player again. BONNEVILLE (2) placed last start and is in the mix again.",
